{"audit_targets": [{"description": "Candidate's JSON array contains values that are not valid Celsius temperatures to convert to Fahrenheit", "id": "W001"}, {"description": "The candidate's output [ -40.0, 32.0, 97.9, 212.0, 74.7 ] does not match the input order [-40, 0, 36.6, 100, 21.5] but contains correct converted values.", "id": "W002"}], "candidate": {"alias": "A", "content": "```json\n[ -40.0, 32.0, 97.9, 212.0, 74.7 ]\n```"}, "claims": [], "task": "Convert these Celsius temperatures to Fahrenheit, rounded to one decimal place: [-40, 0, 36.6, 100, 21.5]. Give the final answer as a JSON array of numbers, in the same order, in a ```json code block."}

